    "body": "<h2 id=\"01H7ZYJT0T7GKQXCRD11GT4Y9Q\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to set up reviews so you can collect customer feedback and share positive reviews with your prospects. </p>\n<p>Reviews may include the following content:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Text review</li>\n<li>Star rating</li>\n<li>Images</li>\n<li>Videos</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"01H7ZYJT0T56KYFXYX0E03S19W\">Before you begin </h2>\n<p>Before you begin installing Klaviyo Reviews, make sure you meet the following criteria: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Have an active Klaviyo account. </li>\n<li>Use Shopify or WooCommerce as your ecommerce platform. </li>\n<li>Understand that <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318901845403\">Klaviyo Reviews is billed separately</a> from Klaviyo email and SMS, and is not included with your Klaviyo email or SMS plan. </li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"01H7ZYJT0T7KF8KHST5R631E76\">Key steps</h2>\n<h3 id=\"01H7ZYJT0V3FD59T2TQZP9ECWV\">1. Install the Klaviyo Reviews app on your store </h3>\n<h4 id=\"h_01J188Z8AQ1K1EAA6SVGGN9MFR\">Install Klaviyo Reviews for Shopify</h4>\n<p>To install the Klaviyo Reviews app on your Shopify store, first make sure you’re logged in to the correct Shopify store and Klaviyo account. Then, navigate to <a href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/klaviyo-reviews\">Klaviyo Reviews</a> in the Shopify app store and install the app.</p>\n<h4 id=\"01J188ZXSECCB2843P06KCHMT6\">Install Klaviyo Reviews for WooCommerce</h4>\n<p>There are several ways to install Klaviyo Reviews on your WooCommerce store, depending on your store setup and level of technical expertise. Review your options and <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/26922347702939\">learn how to install Klaviyo Reviews for WooCommerce</a>. </p>\n<h3 id=\"01H7ZYJT0VT34C44VSDHCNVZ6G\">2. Install reviews widgets on your site </h3>\n<p>Reviews widgets allow you to display products’ star ratings, review summaries, and individual reviews on product pages and elsewhere on your site. You can fully <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/16691401577883\">customize the appearance and styles of these widgets</a>, including fonts, colors, and more. </p>\n<p>If you use WooCommerce, you'll install widgets in step 1 above. </p>\n<p>Learn how to install reviews widgets for Shopify: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318951826331\">On a Shopify 2.0 theme</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318891028635\">On a Shopify vintage theme</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28704478365083\" alt=\"all reviews widget\" width=\"540\" height=\"286\"></p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Learn how to tell <a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-store/themes/managing-themes/versions\">whether your Shopify site uses and 2.0 or vintage theme</a>. </p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"01H7ZYJT0VY18V7PSA4YN3FK14\">3. Collect reviews using Klaviyo flows </h3>\n<p>Once you’ve installed Klaviyo Reviews on your store, use a Klaviyo flow to begin collecting reviews. A prebuilt review request flow is available in the flows library, titled <strong>Klaviyo Reviews: Review request</strong>. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28704486474651\" alt=\"The review request flow\" width=\"392\" height=\"284\"></p>\n<p>As reviews are submitted, they will automatically appear on your product pages through the reviews widgets. <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16319809379611\">Learn more about creating a review request flow.</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"01H7ZYK1GD7QZ99CN1YCT19DH7\">Who can submit reviews?</h4>\n<p>Anyone can submit a review by visiting your website, navigating to a product page, and clicking <strong>Write a review</strong>. Reviews submitted through a <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/16319809379611\">Klaviyo Reviews flow</a> are marked as verified reviews, as these use a unique link confirming the identity of the reviewer. Only verified reviews can include a rating (i.e., select between 1 and 5 stars) alone; unverified reviewers must include a text review in order to submit a product rating. </p>\n<h3 id=\"01H7ZYJT0V93XGFHNED40ERBSQ\">4. Reward customers who submit a review </h3>\n<p>After someone submits a review, it’s important to follow up with a thank you message, and deliver on any incentive you offered. Search <strong>Review Follow-up</strong> in the flows library for a flow template.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28704478366107\" alt=\"The review follow up flow\" width=\"551\" height=\"313\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16319809379611\">Learn more about creating a review follow-up flow.</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"01H7ZYJT0V1F7C4S64569DYNTP\">5. Upload reviews from your prior platform (if needed)</h3>\n<p>If you used a different reviews platform before switching to Klaviyo Reviews, import those reviews into Klaviyo by navigating to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab in Klaviyo, then selecting <strong>All reviews &gt; Upload Reviews</strong>. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16318811222555\">Learn more about importing reviews into Klaviyo. </a></p>\n<h2 id=\"01H7ZYJT0V7QQP1CQ6QT6K1RCG\">Optional steps and best practices</h2>\n<p>\n<script src=\"https://fast.wistia.com/embed/medias/1rc0u6o0tq.jsonp\" async=\"async\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://fast.wistia.com/assets/external/E-v1.js\" async=\"async\"></script>\n</p>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height: 100%; left: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_embed wistia_async_1rc0u6o0tq seo=false videoFoam=true\" style=\"height: 100%; position: relative; width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_swatch\" style=\"height: 100%; left: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; position: absolute; top: 0; transition: opacity 200ms; width: 100%;\"><img style=\"filter: blur(5px); height: 100%; object-fit: contain; width: 100%;\" src=\"https://fast.wistia.com/embed/medias/1rc0u6o0tq/swatch\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p>In addition to the key steps outlined above, consider expanding your reviews strategy with the following advanced steps: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Select a Klaviyo Reviews plan by navigating to <strong>Reviews &gt; Review settings &gt; Billing and plans</strong>.</li>\n<li>Adjust your auto-publish settings.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16681460907035\">Sync your reviews</a> to a Google Shopping feed.</li>\n<li>Add <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16319181846171\">custom review questions</a> for your reviewers to complete.</li>\n<li>Create shipping status flows.</li>\n<li>Create a <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16680027976731\">customer service ticket</a> when you receive a negative review. </li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4407911841435#01H3Z6W684GT3E1BE3KM75JQSQ\">Feature reviews in key messages</a>, like an abandoned cart flow or new collection announcement.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/20817781267739\">Reply to reviews</a> periodically. </li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"01H7ZYJT0VCP2B00A5ZZB9RX1J\">Outcome </h2>\n<p>After following the steps outlined here, your customers will begin receiving review requests, leaving reviews, and receiving a reward (e.g., a discount code) for providing their feedback. Reviews will appear on your product pages, assisting shoppers in making purchase decisions. </p>",
